{"agent":"bgp","data":{"by":"bgp","evidence":{"diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"note":"CONFIRMED: Bug Bab813498a3 ('ddflow_bug action=fixed refuses the union-advertised no_task argument') no longer reproduces. Probe: MCP Server.handle('ddflow_bug', action=fixed, id=B1, no_task=True) in a scratch repo returned the normal 'needs --regression-test' refusal, NOT 'unknown argument no_task'. Mechanism: family_schema._problem now unions every member argument into known (known |= set(_union(family)) - {OP}, commit 46f383622 / B34e7a7001f), so no_task (a bug found argument) is not unknown to action=fixed. Falsifier: route('ddflow_bug', {action:fixed, id:B1, no_task:True}) returning 'unknown argument(s): no_task' (it returns Routed on current main).","reviewed_paths":{"tests/test_mcp_family_route.py":"100644 391c2b5037049424a8041ead76dcef06cb5657ba"},"tree_sha":"86b0e60e361b+clean"},"gate":"research","reason":""},"id":"eddfa9ab78c0df13810de9dd9","kind":"gate.passed","lamport":160992,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-Bab813498a3","ts":"2026-11-09T10:07:30.294712Z"}
